  "description": "<p>Participants:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5ed02d2a7d0c250c236c34d9\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5ed02d2a7d0c250c236c34d9\" data-account-id=\"5ed02d2a7d0c250c236c34d9\" accountid=\"5ed02d2a7d0c250c236c34d9\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Bethany Seeger</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3Abfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:bfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271\" data-account-id=\"557058:bfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271\" accountid=\"557058:bfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Joshua Allan Westgard</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" data-account-id=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" accountid=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Ben Pennell</a></p>\n\n<p>Review Memento, API spec, and Delta documents in order to come up with a design of how versioning and authorization interact in the modeshape impl, as consistent with the relevant specifications.  Identity, answer, or escalate  pertinent questions, such as:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>When resources are versioned, are their ACLs implicitly versioned as well?</li>\n\t<li>To what degree are the versions of a resource and the versions of its ACL independent?</li>\n\t<li>Are ACLs for versioned resources immutable?</li>\n</ul>\n\n",
